⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
350 calories 49g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins included)

Impretzively Fudged Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 145 recipes like this one!

- 1 @Quest Nutrition Chocolate Protein Milkshake
- 20-25g @Lakanto Monk Fruit Sweetener
- 10g cocoa powder
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins:
- 21g chocolate covered pretzels
- Flaky salt
350 cal 26g C, 9g F, 49g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting if powdery
5. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the pretzels
6. Run the “Mix-in” cycle
7. Sprinkle with flaky salt

